Snapshot: 2026-10-10 19:06:00 PDT

PURPOSE AND STATE
Compare Qwen3.5-9B weight quantization at Q8_0, Q6_K, Q5_K_M, Q4_K_M and Q3_K_M. Measure task accuracy/reliability, output tokens, prompt and decoding speed, latency and GPU memory, and examine task-specific failure patterns. Q8 is a quantized reference, not full precision. This is task performance under a fixed inference budget, not a universal intelligence score. No claim of zero training contamination or independently proven upstream conversion equivalence.
All five GGUF files have publisher size and SHA256 verification. The current full Q8 benchmark is running_q8. Snapshot progress: 5/180 attempts completed, 4 primary-correct, 0 truncated, 0 infrastructure errors. These are partial counts, not a final accuracy estimate. Original run: study_v2_Q8_0_full_20261011T015833Z. It continues on the original machine; exporting does not stop it. Results created AFTER this snapshot are absent.

